  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> For each Aristeia feat you possess, increase the number of times per day you can use a combat feats you have that allows a limited number of daily uses by 1, such as the Stunning Fist feat. When your Aristeia ends, you may spend any number of hero points, reducing the ability burn dealt to each ability score by 1 for every hero point spent.<br>\nSpecial: This feat counts as the weapon training and armor training class features for all weapons and armor for the purpose of meeting prerequisites for armor mastery and weapon mastery feat prerequisites and what weapons you can use with weapon mastery feats.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/aristeia-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
